</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 10:34 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I have posted this somewhere else, but while working on the timeline I noticed that Wacko Rader in 1989 Was field operations Supervisor for the US census Bureau, once again having access to peoples personal information, Armchair posted on his thread that a girl named Krista Martin was killed in 10/02 of that year, hmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm<!--/Text--></td></tr>
