<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10524"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 04, 2005 - 4:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->OK here&#39;s the insanity for me, In the timeline we have several victims, some fit Rader, some don&#39;t the one&#39;s that don&#39;t fit together if that makes any sense, so what we have more than one killer is it possible they knew each other, Rader gave them the idea, and they tried to take credit for his work too. Somebody help me understand this And LE lying to us, no way they would ever admit that, because then they could be held responsible for Rader not being caught all these years, This is unreal<!--/Text--></td></tr>
